<header>
  <div class="masthead">
    <span data-en="Direct Trade Uganda" data-de="Direct Trade Uganda">Direct Trade Uganda</span>
    <span data-en="Next consolidated container · Kampala → Hamburg · 2027" data-de="Nächster Sammelcontainer · Kampala → Hamburg · 2027">Next consolidated container · Kampala → Hamburg · 2027</span>
  </div>

  <div class="c">
  <p class="eyebrow" data-en="For farmers and their families" data-de="Für Farmer und ihre Familien">For farmers and their families</p>
  <h1 data-en="Your coffee. &lt;em&gt;Sold in Europe.&lt;/em&gt;" data-de="Euer Kaffee. &lt;em&gt;Verkauft in Europa.&lt;/em&gt;">Your coffee. <em>Sold in Europe.</em></h1>
  <p class="lead" data-en="You keep your coffee until the container is sealed. We handle export papers, shipping and import, and introduce your coffee to roasters. You choose who takes it over in Europe." data-de="Der Kaffee bleibt eurer, bis der Container plombiert ist. Wir übernehmen Exportpapiere, Fracht und Import und stellen euren Kaffee Röstereien vor. Ihr entscheidet, wer ihn in Europa übernimmt.">You keep your coffee until the container is sealed. We handle export papers, shipping and import, and introduce your coffee to roasters. You choose who takes it over in Europe.</p>
  <a class="send" href="#form" data-en="Tell us about yourselves" data-de="Erzählt uns von euch">Tell us about yourselves</a>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="c">
  <p class="sec-note" data-en="Two ways, you choose" data-de="Zwei Wege, ihr wählt">Two ways, you choose</p>
  <p class="lead" data-en="Roasters in Europe buy named lots from named farms. A shared container takes your coffee there from 10 bags. You choose how it is sold." data-de="Röstereien in Europa kaufen benannte Lots von benannten Farmen. Ein Sammelcontainer bringt euren Kaffee ab 10 Sack dorthin. Ihr wählt, wie er verkauft wird.">Roasters in Europe buy named lots from named farms. A shared container takes your coffee there from 10 bags. You choose how it is sold.</p>
  <div class="two">
    <div>
      <h3 data-en="A · Your family in the EU" data-de="A · Eure Familie in der EU">A · Your family in the EU</h3>
      <p class="lead sm" data-en="A relative in the EU takes over the coffee, pays the shipping rate and sells it. You decide who sells and at what price." data-de="Ein Verwandter in der EU übernimmt den Kaffee, zahlt die Rate und verkauft ihn. Ihr entscheidet, wer verkauft und zu welchem Preis.">A relative in the EU takes over the coffee, pays the shipping rate and sells it. You decide who sells and at what price.</p>
      <p class="lead sm" data-en="&lt;b&gt;Our share:&lt;/b&gt; 10% of the sale price, at least &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.40&quot;&gt;EUR 0.40&lt;/span&gt; per kg, on top of the shipping rate, only if a roaster we introduced buys." data-de="&lt;b&gt;Unser Anteil:&lt;/b&gt; 10 % des Verkaufspreises, mindestens &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.40&quot;&gt;0,40 €&lt;/span&gt; je kg, zusätzlich zur Rate, nur wenn ein von uns vorgestellter Röster kauft."><b>Our share:</b> 10% of the sale price, at least <span class="m" data-eur="0.40">EUR 0.40</span> per kg, on top of the shipping rate, only if a roaster we introduced buys.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3 data-en="B · Our stock in Hamburg" data-de="B · Unser Lager in Hamburg">B · Our stock in Hamburg</h3>
      <p class="lead sm" data-en="We buy your lot through the licensed exporter. It becomes ours when the container is sealed, and we sell it to roasters from our Hamburg stock in our own name. No relative needed, nothing to pay up front, costs come out of the sale. Unsold after 12 months, you can buy it back for the costs paid so far." data-de="Wir kaufen euer Lot über den lizenzierten Exporteur. Es wird unseres, wenn der Container plombiert ist, und wir verkaufen es aus unserem Lager in Hamburg in eigenem Namen an Röstereien. Kein Verwandter nötig, nichts vorab zu zahlen, die Kosten kommen aus dem Verkauf. Nach 12 Monaten unverkauft könnt ihr ihn zu den bis dahin gezahlten Kosten zurückkaufen.">We buy your lot through the licensed exporter. It becomes ours when the container is sealed, and we sell it to roasters from our Hamburg stock in our own name. No relative needed, nothing to pay up front, costs come out of the sale. Unsold after 12 months, you can buy it back for the costs paid so far.</p>
      <p class="lead sm" data-en="&lt;b&gt;Our share:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.40&quot;&gt;EUR 0.40&lt;/span&gt; per kg, and half of anything the sale brings above your registered value." data-de="&lt;b&gt;Unser Anteil:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.40&quot;&gt;0,40 €&lt;/span&gt; je kg und die Hälfte von allem, was der Verkauf über eurem eingetragenen Wert bringt."><b>Our share:</b> <span class="m" data-eur="0.40">EUR 0.40</span> per kg, and half of anything the sale brings above your registered value.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="c" id="ex">
  <p class="sec-note" data-en="Example, way B" data-de="Beispiel, Weg B">Example, way B</p>
  <div class="ex-ctl" id="ex-ctl" hidden>
    <div class="lang" role="group" aria-label="Coffee / Kaffee"><button type="button" data-set-var="arabica" aria-pressed="true">Arabica</button><button type="button" data-set-var="robusta" aria-pressed="false">Robusta</button></div>
  </div>
  <p class="stat"><span data-en="You receive" data-de="Ihr bekommt">You receive</span><br><strong data-en="&lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;you&quot; data-eur=&quot;6.05&quot;&gt;EUR 6.05&lt;/span&gt;" data-de="&lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;you&quot; data-eur=&quot;6.05&quot;&gt;6,05 €&lt;/span&gt;"><span class="m" data-k="you" data-eur="6.05">EUR 6.05</span></strong> / kg</p>
  <p class="ex-ref" data-en="Kampala today (UCDA, &lt;span data-grade&gt;Bugisu AA&lt;/span&gt;): &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;kmp&quot; data-eur=&quot;5.2916&quot;&gt;EUR 5.29&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;/&amp;nbsp;kg&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-when=&quot;above&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;diff&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.76&quot;&gt;EUR 0.76&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;more per kg with us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-when=&quot;below&quot; hidden&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;diff&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.76&quot;&gt;EUR 0.76&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;less per kg with us&lt;/span&gt;" data-de="Heute in Kampala (UCDA, &lt;span data-grade&gt;Bugisu AA&lt;/span&gt;): &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;kmp&quot; data-eur=&quot;5.2916&quot;&gt;5,29 €&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;/&amp;nbsp;kg&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-when=&quot;above&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;diff&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.76&quot;&gt;0,76 €&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;mehr je kg mit uns&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-when=&quot;below&quot; hidden&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;diff&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.76&quot;&gt;0,76 €&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;weniger je kg mit uns&lt;/span&gt;">Kampala today (UCDA, <span data-grade>Bugisu AA</span>): <span class="m" data-k="kmp" data-eur="5.2916">EUR 5.29</span>&nbsp;/&nbsp;kg<br><span data-when="above"><span class="m" data-k="diff" data-eur="0.76">EUR 0.76</span>&nbsp;more per kg with us</span><span data-when="below" hidden><span class="m" data-k="diff" data-eur="0.76">EUR 0.76</span>&nbsp;less per kg with us</span></p>
  <div class="ex-ctl" hidden>
    <input type="range" id="ex-price" min="6" max="14" step="0.25" value="9">
    <label for="ex-price" class="ex-lab"><span data-en="If roasters in Hamburg pay &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;price&quot; data-eur=&quot;9.00&quot;&gt;EUR 9.00&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;/&amp;nbsp;kg" data-de="Wenn Röster in Hamburg &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;price&quot; data-eur=&quot;9.00&quot;&gt;9,00 €&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;/&amp;nbsp;kg zahlen">If roasters in Hamburg pay <b><span class="m" data-k="price" data-eur="9.00">EUR 9.00</span></b>&nbsp;/&nbsp;kg</span></label>
  </div>
  <p class="lead sm ex-zone low" data-zone="1" hidden data-en="Commercial quality, under 80 points. In way B you may receive less than the registered value. Selling in Uganda can be the better choice." data-de="Handelsqualität, unter 80 Punkte. Bei Weg B kann weniger ankommen als der eingetragene Wert. Der Verkauf in Uganda kann die bessere Wahl sein.">Commercial quality, under 80 points. In way B you may receive less than the registered value. Selling in Uganda can be the better choice.</p>
  <p class="lead sm ex-zone" data-zone="2" data-en="Specialty, 80 to 84 points, clean cup, plot coordinates complete." data-de="Specialty, 80 bis 84 Punkte, sauberer Cup, Koordinaten aller Flächen vollständig.">Specialty, 80 to 84 points, clean cup, plot coordinates complete.</p>
  <p class="lead sm ex-zone" data-zone="3" hidden data-en="84 to 86 points, or certified organic or Fairtrade, or a farm story roasters can tell." data-de="84 bis 86 Punkte, oder zertifiziert Bio oder Fairtrade, oder eine Farmgeschichte, die Röster erzählen können.">84 to 86 points, or certified organic or Fairtrade, or a farm story roasters can tell.</p>
  <p class="lead sm ex-zone" data-zone="4" hidden data-en="86 points and more, micro-lot. Few lots reach this." data-de="86 Punkte und mehr, Micro-Lot. Das erreichen nur wenige Lots.">86 points and more, micro-lot. Few lots reach this.</p>
  <p class="lead sm" data-en="For 10 bags (600 kg): &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;total&quot; data-eur=&quot;3630.00&quot;&gt;EUR 3,630&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" data-de="Für 10 Sack (600 kg): &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;total&quot; data-eur=&quot;3630.00&quot;&gt;3.630 €&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;">For 10 bags (600 kg): <b><span class="m" data-k="total" data-eur="3630.00">EUR 3,630</span></b></p>
  <svg class="gfx gfx-split" viewBox="0 0 360 36" role="img" aria-labelledby="sp-t"><title id="sp-t">Of EUR 9.00 per kg: you EUR 6.05, Zuricaf EUR 1.16, logistics and cess EUR 1.79</title>
<rect id="bar-you" x="10.0" y="4" width="228.6" height="28" rx="3" class="w-you"/>
<rect id="bar-us" x="238.6" y="4" width="43.8" height="28" rx="3" class="w-us"/>
<rect id="bar-cost" x="282.4" y="4" width="67.6" height="28" rx="3" class="w-cost"/>
</svg>
  <p class="legend"><span class="leg"><i class="w-you"></i><span data-en="You &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;you&quot; data-eur=&quot;6.05&quot;&gt;EUR 6.05&lt;/span&gt;" data-de="Ihr &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;you&quot; data-eur=&quot;6.05&quot;&gt;6,05 €&lt;/span&gt;">You <span class="m" data-k="you" data-eur="6.05">EUR 6.05</span></span></span><span class="leg"><i class="w-us"></i><span data-en="Zuricaf (marketing and sales) &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;us&quot; data-eur=&quot;1.16&quot;&gt;EUR 1.16&lt;/span&gt;" data-de="Zuricaf (Marketing und Vertrieb) &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;us&quot; data-eur=&quot;1.16&quot;&gt;1,16 €&lt;/span&gt;">Zuricaf (marketing and sales) <span class="m" data-k="us" data-eur="1.16">EUR 1.16</span></span></span><span class="leg"><i class="w-cost"></i><span data-en="Logistics and cess &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;cost&quot; data-eur=&quot;1.79&quot;&gt;EUR 1.79&lt;/span&gt;" data-de="Logistik und Cess &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;cost&quot; data-eur=&quot;1.79&quot;&gt;1,79 €&lt;/span&gt;">Logistics and cess <span class="m" data-k="cost" data-eur="1.79">EUR 1.79</span></span></span></p>
  <details class="ex-more"><summary data-en="How it is calculated" data-de="So wird gerechnet">How it is calculated</summary>
  <p class="lead sm" data-en="You pay nothing up front. We buy your lot when the container is sealed. The price we pay you is what our buyer pays us, minus the shipping rate, cess, storage, insurance and our share. If the sale does not cover the costs, you owe us nothing." data-de="Ihr zahlt vorab nichts. Wir kaufen euer Lot, wenn der Container plombiert ist. Der Preis, den wir euch zahlen, ist das, was unser Käufer uns zahlt, abzüglich Rate, Cess, Lager, Versicherung und unseres Anteils. Deckt der Verkauf die Kosten nicht, schuldet ihr uns nichts.">You pay nothing up front. We buy your lot when the container is sealed. The price we pay you is what our buyer pays us, minus the shipping rate, cess, storage, insurance and our share. If the sale does not cover the costs, you owe us nothing.</p>
  <p class="lead sm" data-en="Registered value: set from the official UCDA daily price at registration. On 10 Nov 2026 (UCDA/MAAIF Daily Coffee Market Report): &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;reg&quot; data-eur=&quot;5.29&quot;&gt;EUR 5.29&lt;/span&gt; per kg." data-de="Eingetragener Wert: bei der Registrierung aus dem offiziellen UCDA-Tagespreis gesetzt. Am 10.11.2026 (UCDA/MAAIF Daily Coffee Market Report): &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;reg&quot; data-eur=&quot;5.29&quot;&gt;5,29 €&lt;/span&gt; je kg.">Registered value: set from the official UCDA daily price at registration. On 10 Nov 2026 (UCDA/MAAIF Daily Coffee Market Report): <span class="m" data-k="reg" data-eur="5.29">EUR 5.29</span> per kg.</p>
  <p class="fine" data-en="Example, not a quote. The price depends on the sale and on the exchange rate. We pay you within 10 working days after we invoice the roaster, who pays in advance. Below a sale price of &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;be&quot; data-eur=&quot;7.48&quot;&gt;EUR 7.48&lt;/span&gt; per kg you receive less than the registered value. Unsold after 12 months, you can buy it back for the costs paid so far; otherwise we sell it at the best price available. The shipping rate falls as the container fills. Places are limited to 10 bags per owner in each run." data-de="Beispiel, kein Angebot. Der Preis hängt vom Verkauf und vom Wechselkurs ab. Wir zahlen euch binnen 10 Werktagen, nachdem wir dem Röster die Rechnung gestellt haben, der im Voraus zahlt. Unter einem Verkaufspreis von &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;be&quot; data-eur=&quot;7.48&quot;&gt;7,48 €&lt;/span&gt; je kg bekommt ihr weniger als den eingetragenen Wert. Nach 12 Monaten unverkauft könnt ihr ihn zu den bis dahin gezahlten Kosten zurückkaufen; sonst verkaufen wir ihn zum besten erreichbaren Preis. Die Rate sinkt, je voller der Container wird. Pro Owner und Run sind die Plätze auf 10 Sack begrenzt.">Example, not a quote. The price depends on the sale and on the exchange rate. We pay you within 10 working days after we invoice the roaster, who pays in advance. Below a sale price of <span class="m" data-k="be" data-eur="7.48">EUR 7.48</span> per kg you receive less than the registered value. Unsold after 12 months, you can buy it back for the costs paid so far; otherwise we sell it at the best price available. The shipping rate falls as the container fills. Places are limited to 10 bags per owner in each run.</p>
  <p class="lead sm" data-en="Per kg. &lt;b&gt;Costs &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;cost&quot; data-eur=&quot;1.79&quot;&gt;EUR 1.79&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/b&gt; shipping rate &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-eur=&quot;1.60&quot;&gt;EUR 1.60&lt;/span&gt;, Uganda cess &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;cess&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.11&quot;&gt;EUR 0.11&lt;/span&gt;, storage and insurance &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.08&quot;&gt;EUR 0.08&lt;/span&gt;." data-de="Je kg. &lt;b&gt;Kosten &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;cost&quot; data-eur=&quot;1.79&quot;&gt;1,79 €&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/b&gt; Rate &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-eur=&quot;1.60&quot;&gt;1,60 €&lt;/span&gt;, Uganda Cess &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;cess&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.11&quot;&gt;0,11 €&lt;/span&gt;, Lager und Versicherung &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.08&quot;&gt;0,08 €&lt;/span&gt;.">Per kg. <b>Costs <span class="m" data-k="cost" data-eur="1.79">EUR 1.79</span>:</b> shipping rate <span class="m" data-eur="1.60">EUR 1.60</span>, Uganda cess <span class="m" data-k="cess" data-eur="0.11">EUR 0.11</span>, storage and insurance <span class="m" data-eur="0.08">EUR 0.08</span>.</p>
  <p class="lead sm" data-when="above" data-en="&lt;b&gt;Our share &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;us&quot; data-eur=&quot;1.16&quot;&gt;EUR 1.16&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/b&gt; base share &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.40&quot;&gt;EUR 0.40&lt;/span&gt;, plus half of the &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;above&quot; data-eur=&quot;1.52&quot;&gt;EUR 1.52&lt;/span&gt; above your registered value." data-de="&lt;b&gt;Unser Anteil &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;us&quot; data-eur=&quot;1.16&quot;&gt;1,16 €&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/b&gt; Grundanteil &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.40&quot;&gt;0,40 €&lt;/span&gt; und die Hälfte der &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;above&quot; data-eur=&quot;1.52&quot;&gt;1,52 €&lt;/span&gt; über eurem eingetragenen Wert."><b>Our share <span class="m" data-k="us" data-eur="1.16">EUR 1.16</span>:</b> base share <span class="m" data-eur="0.40">EUR 0.40</span>, plus half of the <span class="m" data-k="above" data-eur="1.52">EUR 1.52</span> above your registered value.</p>
  <p class="lead sm" data-when="below" hidden data-en="&lt;b&gt;Our share &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;us&quot; data-eur=&quot;1.16&quot;&gt;EUR 1.16&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/b&gt; the base share only, because the sale stays below your registered value." data-de="&lt;b&gt;Unser Anteil &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;us&quot; data-eur=&quot;1.16&quot;&gt;1,16 €&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/b&gt; nur der Grundanteil, weil der Verkauf unter eurem eingetragenen Wert bleibt."><b>Our share <span class="m" data-k="us" data-eur="1.16">EUR 1.16</span>:</b> the base share only, because the sale stays below your registered value.</p>
  <p class="lead sm" data-en="If the sale brings less than your registered value, you receive what is left after costs and we keep only &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.40&quot;&gt;EUR 0.40&lt;/span&gt; per kg." data-de="Bringt der Verkauf weniger als euren eingetragenen Wert, bekommt ihr, was nach den Kosten übrig ist, und wir behalten nur &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.40&quot;&gt;0,40 €&lt;/span&gt; je kg.">If the sale brings less than your registered value, you receive what is left after costs and we keep only <span class="m" data-eur="0.40">EUR 0.40</span> per kg.</p>
  <p class="lead sm" data-en="Way A with the same coffee: your relative pays the shipping rate of &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-eur=&quot;1.60&quot;&gt;EUR 1.60&lt;/span&gt; per kg and sells. We receive 10% of the sale price, here &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;wa&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.90&quot;&gt;EUR 0.90&lt;/span&gt; per kg, only if a roaster we introduced buys." data-de="Weg A mit demselben Kaffee: Euer Verwandter zahlt die Rate von &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-eur=&quot;1.60&quot;&gt;1,60 €&lt;/span&gt; je kg und verkauft. Wir bekommen 10 % des Verkaufspreises, hier &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;wa&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.90&quot;&gt;0,90 €&lt;/span&gt; je kg, nur wenn ein von uns vorgestellter Röster kauft.">Way A with the same coffee: your relative pays the shipping rate of <span class="m" data-eur="1.60">EUR 1.60</span> per kg and sells. We receive 10% of the sale price, here <span class="m" data-k="wa" data-eur="0.90">EUR 0.90</span> per kg, only if a roaster we introduced buys.</p>
  </details>
  <p class="fine" data-en="Example, not a quote. The price is only known after cupping and sale. The zones describe typical lots, not a grading of yours. Net of VAT where it applies. Amounts are set in EUR. UGX figures are rounded approximations at the mid-market rate of 9 Nov 2026 (EUR 1 = UGX 4,586); the rate changes." data-de="Beispiel, kein Angebot. Der Preis steht erst nach Cupping und Verkauf fest. Die Zonen beschreiben typische Lots, keine Bewertung eures Lots. Ohne Umsatzsteuer, soweit sie anfällt. Beträge gelten in EUR. UGX-Werte sind gerundete Näherungen zum Mittelkurs vom 9.11.2026 (1 € = 4.586 UGX); der Kurs ändert sich.">Example, not a quote. The price is only known after cupping and sale. The zones describe typical lots, not a grading of yours. Net of VAT where it applies. Amounts are set in EUR. UGX figures are rounded approximations at the mid-market rate of 9 Nov 2026 (EUR 1 = UGX 4,586); the rate changes.</p>
</section>

<section class="c">
  <p class="sec-note" data-en="Route and process" data-de="Route und Ablauf">Route and process</p>
  <svg class="gfx gfx-route" viewBox="0 0 360 130" role="img" aria-labelledby="rt-b"><title id="rt-b">Route Kampala, by road to Mombasa, by sea to Hamburg</title>
